{"seq":3,"slug":"positioning-and-stacking","title":"定位与层叠上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/positioning-and-stacking","wordCount":713,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"定位与层叠上下文\">定位与层叠上下文</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>CSS 定位允许元素脱离正常文档流，精确控制位置。当多个定位元素重叠时，<strong>层叠上下文（Stacking Context）</strong> 决定了它们的前后遮挡关系。理解定位类型与层叠上下文的创建条件，是构建复杂 UI 组件（弹窗、下拉菜单、吸顶导航）的必备知识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>定位（<code>position</code>）描述元素相对谁、按什么参照物偏移；层叠上下文（Stacking Context）则是一棵按 <code>z-index</code> 分层的独立渲染子树——一旦元素创建了新的层叠上下文，其内部的 <code>z-index</code> 就只在该子树内比较，这正是许多&quot;弹窗压不住&quot;问题的根源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;position 属性&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;static&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;relative&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;absolute&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;fixed&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;sticky&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;正常文档流&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H[&quot;相对自身偏移,保留原始空间&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; I[&quot;相对最近定位祖先偏移,脱离文档流&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; J[&quot;相对视口偏移,脱离文档流&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; K[&quot;滚动到阈值前为 relative,之后为 fixed&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"position 属性\"] --&gt; B[\"static\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"relative\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"absolute\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"fixed\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"sticky\"]\n    B --&gt; G[\"正常文档流\"]\n    C --&gt; H[\"相对自身偏移,保留原始空间\"]\n    D --&gt; I[\"相对最近定位祖先偏移,脱离文档流\"]\n    E --&gt; J[\"相对视口偏移,脱离文档流\"]\n    F --&gt; K[\"滚动到阈值前为 relative,之后为 fixed\"]</pre><h2 id=\"五种定位类型\">五种定位类型</h2><h3 id=\"static-默认\">static（默认）</h3><p>元素处于正常文档流中，<code>top/right/bottom/left/z-index</code> 属性无效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".default {&#10;  position: static;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"relative\">relative</h3><p>元素保留在文档流中的原始空间，视觉上相对自身偏移：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".nudge {&#10;  position: relative;&#10;  top: 10px;&#10;  left: 20px;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.nudge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">relative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"absolute\">absolute</h3><p>元素脱离文档流，相对于最近的<strong>非 static</strong> 定位祖先偏移：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".dropdown {&#10;  position: relative;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.dropdown-menu {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;  top: 100%;&#10;  left: 0;&#10;  width: 200px;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.dropdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">relative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.dropdown-menu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"fixed\">fixed</h3><p>元素相对于<strong>视口</strong>定位，滚动时不动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".navbar {&#10;  position: fixed;&#10;  top: 0;&#10;  left: 0;&#10;  right: 0;&#10;  z-index: 100;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.navbar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sticky\">sticky</h3><p>元素在滚动到指定阈值前表现为 <code>relative</code>，到达后&quot;粘&quot;在指定位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".section-header {&#10;  position: sticky;&#10;  top: 0;&#10;  z-index: 10;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.section-header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sticky</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>sticky</code> 元素的包含块是其最近的可滚动祖先。如果父元素设置了 <code>overflow: hidden</code>，sticky 可能失效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"定位类型对比\">定位类型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性值</th>\n<th>文档流</th>\n<th>偏移参照</th>\n<th>创建层叠上下文</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>static</code></td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>无偏移</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>relative</code></td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>自身原始位置</td>\n<td>z-index 非 auto 时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>absolute</code></td>\n<td>脱离</td>\n<td>最近定位祖先</td>\n<td>z-index 非 auto 时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fixed</code></td>\n<td>脱离</td>\n<td>视口</td>\n<td>始终创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sticky</code></td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>可滚动祖先</td>\n<td>始终创建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"层叠上下文\">层叠上下文</h2><p>层叠上下文是一个三维概念——元素在 Z 轴方向上的排列由层叠上下文和层叠顺序共同决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"创建层叠上下文的条件\">创建层叠上下文的条件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 根元素 &lt;html&gt; 自动创建 */&#10;&#10;/* position + z-index */&#10;.ctx-a {&#10;  position: relative;&#10;  z-index: 1;&#10;}&#10;.ctx-b {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;  z-index: 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 固定/粘性定位始终创建 */&#10;.ctx-c {&#10;  position: fixed;&#10;  top: 0;&#10;}&#10;.ctx-d {&#10;  position: sticky;&#10;  top: 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* opacity 小于 1 */&#10;.ctx-e {&#10;  opacity: 0.99;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* transform 非 none */&#10;.ctx-f {&#10;  transform: translateZ(0);&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 其他触发条件 */&#10;.ctx-g {&#10;  filter: blur(0);&#10;}&#10;.ctx-h {&#10;  will-change: transform;&#10;}&#10;.ctx-i {&#10;  isolation: isolate;&#10;}&#10;.ctx-j {&#10;  contain: layout;&#10;}&#10;.ctx-k {&#10;  mix-blend-mode: multiply;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 根元素 &#x3C;html> 自动创建 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* position + z-index */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.ctx-a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">relative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.ctx-b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 固定/粘性定位始终创建 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.ctx-c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.ctx-d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sticky</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* opacity 小于 1 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.ctx-e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shik