ackground-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  isolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isolate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> .badge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  z-index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 给组件根元素加 <code>isolation: isolate</code> 可以防止内部 z-index 泄露到外部，避免不同组件之间的层叠冲突。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"transform-导致-fixed-失效\">transform 导致 fixed 失效</h3><p>当祖先元素有 <code>transform</code> 时，<code>position: fixed</code> 子元素的包含块变为该祖先，而非视口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;div style=&quot;transform: translateX(0);&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;div style=&quot;position: fixed; top: 0;&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- 不会相对视口定位！ --&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- 而是相对 transform 祖先定位 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> style</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transform: translateX(0);\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> style</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"position: fixed; top: 0;\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- 不会相对视口定位！ --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!-- 而是相对 transform 祖先定位 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sticky-失效排查\">sticky 失效排查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 常见原因 1：父元素 overflow 非 visible */&#10;.parent {&#10;  overflow: hidden; /* sticky 子元素失效 */&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 常见原因 2：未设置 top/bottom 等阈值 */&#10;.sticky-element {&#10;  position: sticky;&#10;  /* 缺少 top: 0; 所以不会粘住 */&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 常见原因 3：父元素高度不够 */&#10;.short-parent {&#10;  height: 50px; /* 子元素没有滚动空间 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 常见原因 1：父元素 overflow 非 visible */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.parent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  overflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* sticky 子元素失效 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 常见原因 2：未设置 top/bottom 等阈值 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.sticky-element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sticky</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 缺少 top: 0; 所以不会粘住 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 常见原因 3：父元素高度不够 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.short-parent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 子元素没有滚动空间 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CSS 提供五种定位：<code>static</code>、<code>relative</code>、<code>absolute</code>、<code>fixed</code>、<code>sticky</code></li>\n<li><strong>层叠上下文</strong>由 <code>z-index</code>、<code>transform</code>、<code>opacity</code>、<code>filter</code> 等多种属性触发</li>\n<li>层叠顺序遵循七层规则，同层按 DOM 出现顺序后来居上</li>\n<li>使用 CSS 变量建立 <strong>z-index 层级体系</strong>可避免数值失控</li>\n<li><strong><code>isolation: isolate</code></strong> 是创建层叠上下文最干净的方式，推荐在组件根元素使用</li>\n<li><code>transform</code> 会改变 <code>fixed</code> 子元素的包含块，是常见的定位陷阱</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定位与层叠上下文","id":"定位与层叠上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五种定位类型","id":"五种定位类型"},{"level":3,"text":"static（默认）","id":"static-默认"},{"level":3,"text":"relative","id":"relative"},{"level":3,"text":"absolute","id":"absolute"},{"level":3,"text":"fixed","id":"fixed"},{"level":3,"text":"sticky","id":"sticky"},{"level":2,"text":"定位类型对比","id":"定位类型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"层叠上下文","id":"层叠上下文"},{"level":3,"text":"创建层叠上下文的条件","id":"创建层叠上下文的条件"},{"level":3,"text":"层叠顺序","id":"层叠顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"z-index 管理策略","id":"z-index-管理策略"},{"level":3,"text":"isolation: isolate","id":"isolation-isolate"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"transform 导致 fixed 失效","id":"transform-导致-fixed-失效"},{"level":3,"text":"sticky 失效排查","id":"sticky-失效排查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"盒模型与布局模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/box-model-and-layout-modes"},"next":{"title":"CSS 自定义属性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/fundamentals/css-variables"}}